//    objects'"
//
// ── PORTED FROM 52a1b92 (branch claude/region-wall-intersection-1bd334) ──
// `src/scene/wallPort.ts` on that unmerged commit is the donor; it was
// extracted for this lane and read in full. What travelled, by line:
